u_1}\cdots x_m^{
u_m}$ (step 2) one has $1\otimes c=\sum(1\otimes\varphi_0(b))(1\otimes x_1)^{
u_1}\cdots(1\otimes x_m)^{
u_m}\in R$, and then $a\otimes c=(a\otimes1)(1\otimes c)\in R$. The pure tensors $a\otimes c$ span $C_{i'}$ additively [def-weil-module-base-change], so $R=C_{i'}$: $\varphi_{i'}$ is surjective, with $i'\ge0$. (Stacks: 'Then this $i$ works.')
